DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261022T190000
UID:6a77431688e9bf2800366be0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Chef Yumiko Kobayashi will provide a brief cultural history ab
 out "Furutsu Sandos"\, or Japanese fruit sandwiches\, then lead a hands-on
  demonstration and workshop to make "Furutsu Sandos” consisting of fresh
  fruit fillings\, bread and whipping cream.\nFood allergy notice: Please b
 e aware that food will be used in this program that contains gluten and da
 iry.  Certain food ingredients may cause allergic reactions in some people
 . ​
