BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tech made Easy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260917T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260917T110000
UID:6a8dfd3bbe148200298a020c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Need help with your phone\, tablet\, laptop\, or other device?
  Drop in and get one-on-one assistance with basic technology questions.\nP
 articipants can bring their own devices and receive help with topics such 
 as device settings\, email\, apps\, internet browsing\, video calling\, fi
 le management\, and other everyday technology tasks.\nPlease note that ass
 istance is limited to basic troubleshooting and guidance. Complex technica
 l issues\, hardware repairs\, data recovery\, programming\, and specialize
 d IT support are outside the scope of this program.
LOCATION:Albion\, Program Room 1
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a8dfd3bbe148200298a020c
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
