 hallenges and celebrate the joys of parenting a child with a disability.\n
 For this\nThirteenth\nsession\, Claudia Jeyagnanam\, Education and Outrea
 ch Facilitator at STRIDES TORONTO\nwill be our guest speaker. Session Dat
 es and Guest Speakers will be announced as they become confirmed.
