 rop in. No registration required.\n**THERE WILL BE NO SESSION ON LABOUR DA
 Y - MONDAY\, SEPTEMBER 7\, AS THE LIBRARY WILL BE CLOSED**\nSnacks and re
 freshments are provided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be av
 ailable at the program.\nThis program is in collaboration with\nGerstein C
 risis Centre's F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
