  and let us know what information and resources you would like to access a
 t the library and in the community.\nSnacks and refreshments are provided 
 for all participants. Ingredient lists will be available at the program.\n
 No registration required.  All are welcome!\nVolunteer Toronto\nHave a co
 nversation with Volunteer Toronto staff and volunteers about formal volunt
 eering in Canada. Volunteer Toronto is Canada’s largest volunteer centre
  with 50 years of experience connecting volunteers to non-profit organizat
 ions. Learn how to start your volunteering journey. Discover where you can
  find volunteer roles on Volunteer Toronto's online portal\, how to apply\
 , and what to expect after applying. Learn how volunteering can also help 
 build skills\, upgrade your resume\, connect with communities\, and networ
 k.
