  varied reactions to the complexity and transitional nature of AI. If you
  agree - and believe the need for understanding our current and coming hum
 an relationships with AI is at a premium -  you will want to attend this 
 presentation.\nKeith McDonald\, from Toronto's the literacy AI project\, p
 resents a 60 minute session using a 5 piece puzzle as an illuminating met
 aphor. Each of the 5 pieces represents a separate but critical aspect towa
