DESCRIPTION:What if you could build an app just by describing it\, with no
  coding experience needed? That's vibe coding.\nIn this workshop\, you'll 
 use an AI coding assistant to build your own small\, useful webpage\, chec
 klist\, or organizer from scratch. You'll learn the build loop: describe w
 hat you want\, review the plan\, build one feature\, test it\, fix the bug
 s\, and write documentation so you (or anyone) can understand it later.\nP
 rerequisites: Mouse\, keyboarding and internet skills. Computers are pro
 vided. No coding experience required.\nRegistration is required and will 
 start October 9\, 2026 at 12:30 PM.\nNote: Your spot will not be guarantee
 d after 5 minutes of the start of the program.\nPrivacy and Risk Message\n
