 h include best practices on using AI.\nWe encourage you to review the priv
 acy statements of each tool prior to attending this program:\nClaude Code\
 nLearn more about the tool\nReview privacy policy\nClaude Cowork\nLearn mo
 re about the tool\nReview privacy policy\nGoogle Anti-Gravity\nLearn more 
