DESCRIPTION:You've got the business idea. Now come the thousand questions:
  who's my customer\, what's the market\, how do I pitch this?\nIn this cla
 ss\, you'll use AI as a research and planning partner for small business. 
 We'll practice together on a sample business\, turning rough ideas into bu
 siness plans\, digging into markets\, drafting customer-discovery question
 s\, and building useful low-maintenance automation. The most valuable thin
 g you'll get is usually a better question to be tested in the real world. 
 Whether you're starting or growing\, you'll leave with an experiment you c
 an run on your own business this week.\nPrerequisites: Mouse\, keyboardin
 g and internet skills. Computers are provided. No coding experience requ
 ired.\nRegistration is required and will start October 9\, 2026 at 12:30 P
