UID:6a94720c60ccaf01c022227b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a hands-on\, two-session crochet pencil case works
 hop. Over two days\, we'll guide you through the full project from start t
 o finish\n. Both sessions are required\n\, as the second continues directl
 y from the first. All skill levels welcome.\nRegistration required.\nPleas
 e register online or call the branch for assistance.
